WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.364
One morning Bird was drawing.

2
00:00:14.365 --> 00:00:17.511
"What are you doing?" asked Kip.

3
00:00:17.512 --> 00:00:21.410
"I'm drawing a bird," said Bird.

4
00:00:21.411 --> 00:00:27.579
"Wow," said Kip.

5
00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:30.607
"I didn't know you like to draw."

6
00:00:30.608 --> 00:00:38.164
"Oh, I love to draw," said Bird.

7
00:00:38.165 --> 00:00:44.507
"You're very good at it," said Kip.

8
00:00:44.508 --> 00:00:49.395
"I wish I was good at something."

9
00:00:49.396 --> 00:00:55.052
"You're good at something," said Bird.

10
00:00:55.053 --> 00:00:57.814
"You're good at cooking.

11
00:00:57.815 --> 00:01:02.661
You made that yummy acorn gumbo."

12
00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:06.587
"But it smelled bad," said Kip.

13
00:01:06.588 --> 00:01:10.045
"So I'm not that good at cooking.

14
00:01:10.046 --> 00:01:13.750
I wish I was very good at something."

15
00:01:13.751 --> 00:01:24.483
"There must be something," said Bird.

16
00:01:24.484 --> 00:01:30.685
Kip tried to think of something.

17
00:01:30.686 --> 00:01:36.968
He thought and thought.

18
00:01:36.969 --> 00:01:42.049
At last he had an idea.

19
00:01:42.050 --> 00:01:44.960
"I know, Bird!" said Kip.

20
00:01:44.961 --> 00:01:52.555
"Watch this!"

21
00:01:52.556 --> 00:01:57.003
"What are you doing?" asked Bird.

22
00:01:57.004 --> 00:02:00.482
"I'm standing on my head!" said Kip.

23
00:02:00.483 --> 00:02:08.372
"I'm going to be very good at it!"

